body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1356\n\nReporter independently observed a dry-run boolean receipt without canonical settings on published 2026.9.30. Named governance preset normalization is correct, but the callback proposal differs from the effective persisted result. No settings/history preview writes were reported. Current-tree design and implementation are pending.\n\nRequested contract: A copied extension can obtain the exact validated effective settings preview through the host capability without duplicate normalization or a local SDK runtime import.\n\nVerification plan: reproduce the public report in a temporary project outside this checkout with both PM roots isolated, demonstrate a relevant regression, then validate the SDK boundary, thin transport where applicable, complete coverage and packed consumers. No implementation is included in PR #1353."
